## Interface: 16001
## Title: Chroma Bridge
## Notes: Draws a tiny status strip in the bottom-left corner for chroma-bridge.ps1 to read and turn into Razer lighting.
## Version: 0.1.0
## Author: Levi Hackwith

# Lines starting with "##" are metadata WoW reads; a single "#" is a comment.
# "## Interface" is the game build this addon targets. If it doesn't match the running game,
# WoW lists the addon as out of date. install.ps1 rewrites it to match each installed game
# version, so the value above (WoW Forever 1.60.1) only matters for manual installs.
# The remaining lines are the Lua files to load, in order.

ChromaBridge.lua
